# Agents Guide

## Virtual commands
- `poe lint` → run full pre-commit suite  
- `poe test` → coverage-tracked pytest  
- `poe profile` → create data-profiling HTML  

## Coding Guidelines
- Target Python {{ python_version }} (see `pyproject.toml`).  
- Disallow old `typing.List`, `typing.Dict`; use built-ins.  
- Line length 100; follow `ruff` auto-fix suggestions.  
- Public functions need **NumPy-style** docstrings.  
- Prefer vectorised `pandas` / `numpy` over Python loops.
